1
00:00:00,581 --> 00:00:02,541
(Leslie:)They just wouldn't listen.

2
00:00:03,709 --> 00:00:06,379
(Howard:)Well, we're surrounded.

3
00:00:06,546 --> 00:00:11,756
(Howard:)So I guess there's nothing for us to do
but wait to be captured or killed.

4
00:00:11,926 --> 00:00:14,306
Hm. That's the worst part.

5
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:15,600
(Leslie:)The waiting.

6
00:00:15,763 --> 00:00:21,183
(Howard:)All the while knowing that there's a paint
pellet out there with your name on it.

7
00:00:21,811 --> 00:00:23,021
(Howard:)Yeah.

8
00:00:23,187 --> 00:00:26,397
(Leslie:)The big wet ball of death.

9
00:00:26,732 --> 00:00:28,732
[PAINTBALLS SPRAYING SHED]

10
00:00:30,111 --> 00:00:33,071
(Leslie:)Kind of makes you feel more alive,
doesn't it?

11
00:00:33,781 --> 00:00:35,741
(Howard:)It kind of does.

12
00:00:37,451 --> 00:00:39,241
(Leslie:)I say we make every moment count.

13
00:00:39,954 --> 00:00:41,834
(Howard:)I agree.

14
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:44,500
(Howard:)How exactly do we do that?

15
00:00:46,002 --> 00:00:48,002
[PAINTBALLS FIRING IN DISTANCE]

16
00:00:48,171 --> 00:00:49,801
LEONARD:
Howard, why aren't you covering us?

17
00:00:49,964 --> 00:00:52,594
(Leonard(voice):)We're getting slaughtered out here.

18
00:00:52,758 --> 00:00:57,018
(Howard:)War is hell.

